      "text": "184. $b$\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u6570\u65f6\uff0c\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u7ec4$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\leqslant3x+1,\\\\y\\geqslant3x+b\\end{array}\\right.$\u7ed9\u51fa\u7684\u70b9\u7684\u96c6\u5408\u662f\uff1a\na) \u5e26\u5f62\uff1b\nb) \u7a7a\u96c6\uff1f",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "185",
      "text": "185. \u753b\u7ec6\u7ebf\u6761\u8868\u793a\u7531\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u7ec4\u7ed9\u51fa\u7684\u5750\u6807\u5e73\u9762\u4e0a\u70b9\u7684\u96c6\u5408\uff1a\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant9,\\\\x^2+y^2\\geqslant1.69;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant36,\\\\|x|>1;\\end{array}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant100,\\\\|x|<8;\\end{array}\\right.$\nd) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant1.44,\\\\xy\\geqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$\ne) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant100,\\\\x^2+y^2\\geqslant64,\\\\xy\\leqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nf) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant x^2,\\\\y\\leqslant-x^2+9;\\end{array}\\right.$\ng) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant x^2+4x+4,\\\\y\\leqslant4;\\end{array}\\right.$\nh) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant(x-1)^2,\\\\y\\leqslant3.5;\\end{array}\\right.$\ni) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant(x-2)(x-3),\\\\y\\leqslant0.\\end{array}\\right.$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "187",
      "text": "187. \u6c42\u51fa\u7531\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u7ec4\u7ed9\u51fa\u7684\u56fe\u5f62$F$\u7684\u9762\u79ef\uff1a\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant|x|,\\\\y\\leqslant4;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant|x|,\\\\y\\leqslant0.5x+1.5.\\end{array}\\right.$",
      "figure_ids": []
    }
